    {
      "name": "Unofficial_cc11",
      "comment": "cc=11 broad pattern — 64 opcodes by aaa selector. Irregular cc=11 opcodes (ANC/ALR/ARR/XAA/AHX/TAS/SHY/SHX/LAS/AXS/SBC_alt) are mask 0xFF entries ABOVE which take priority via decoder first-match-wins.",
